# 🚀 Production Readiness Plan - AIBodyScan

A phased approach to make the website production-ready like Cursor AI, Flipkart, etc.

---

## Current State Assessment

| Area | Status | Notes |
|------|--------|-------|
| **CI/CD** | ✅ Exists | Backend tests, frontend build, Docker, security scan |
| **Testing** | ⚠️ Limited | Basic import tests, no unit/integration coverage |
| **Security** | 🔄 In Progress | Rate limiting, CORS, validation added |
| **Performance** | ❌ Not tested | No load testing, no Lighthouse audits |
| **Monitoring** | ❌ Missing | No error tracking, APM, or logging infrastructure |
| **Documentation** | ⚠️ Scattered | Multiple markdown files, no unified docs |

---

## 📋 Phase Overview

```mermaid
gantt
    title Production Readiness Phases
    dateFormat  YYYY-MM-DD
    section Phase 1
    Security Hardening       :p1, 2026-02-03, 5d
    section Phase 2
    Testing & Quality        :p2, after p1, 7d
    section Phase 3
    Performance Optimization :p3, after p2, 5d
    section Phase 4
    Monitoring & Observability :p4, after p3, 4d
    section Phase 5
    Documentation & Deployment :p5, after p4, 3d
```

