## Phase 1: Security Hardening 🔒 (Priority: Critical)

**Goal:** Secure the application against common vulnerabilities

### Tasks

#### 1.1 Backend Security ✅ COMPLETE
- [x] Add rate limiting to all API endpoints (slowapi) ✅
- [x] Implement request validation with Pydantic strict mode ✅
- [x] Add CORS configuration review ✅
- [x] Implement secure session management ✅ (refresh token rotation in auth.py)
- [x] Add API key rotation mechanism ✅ (api_key_manager.py)
- [x] Secure Razorpay webhook signature verification ✅ (already implemented)
- [x] Remove/secure sensitive files ([.env](file:///d:/3Dmodel/website/.env), `rzp-key.csv`) ✅

#### 1.2 Frontend Security ✅ COMPLETE
- [x] Add Content Security Policy (CSP) headers ✅
- [x] Implement XSS protection in input fields ✅
- [x] Secure token storage (tokenStorage.ts) ✅
- [x] Add CSRF protection (via Auth headers + CORS) ✅

#### 1.3 Infrastructure Security ✅ COMPLETE
- [x] Review and harden environment variable management ✅
- [x] Implement secrets rotation policy ✅ (docs/SECRETS_ROTATION.md)
- [x] Add dependency vulnerability monitoring (Dependabot) ✅
- [x] Docker image security scan and hardening ✅

---

