## Phase 3: Performance Optimization ⚡ (Priority: High)

**Goal:** Ensure fast, responsive experience at scale

### Tasks

#### 3.1 Frontend Performance ✅
- [x] Implement code splitting with React.lazy (11 route chunks)
- [x] Create OptimizedImage component with IntersectionObserver lazy loading
- [x] Add service worker with Workbox caching strategies
- [x] Create serviceWorkerRegistration.ts for SW lifecycle management
- [x] Configure ESLint for frontend code quality

#### 3.2 Backend Performance ✅
- [x] Add Redis caching layer (enhanced [cache_service.py](file:///d:/3Dmodel/integrations/cache_service.py) with decorator)
- [x] Optimize database queries with proper indexing (verified indexes exist)
- [x] Implement connection pooling (StaticPool for SQLite)
- [x] Add response compression (GZip middleware > 500 bytes)
- [x] Profile and optimize slow endpoints (timing middleware)

#### 3.3 Load Testing ✅
- [x] Set up k6 for load testing ([api-load-test.js](file:///d:/3Dmodel/tests/load/api-load-test.js), [database-load-test.js](file:///d:/3Dmodel/tests/load/database-load-test.js))
- [x] Test API under 100, 500, 1000 concurrent users (smoke/load/stress/spike scenarios)
- [x] Identify bottlenecks and optimize (timing middleware, thresholds)
- [x] Test database performance under load ([database-load-test.js](file:///d:/3Dmodel/tests/load/database-load-test.js))
- [x] Document performance benchmarks ([README.md](file:///d:/3Dmodel/api/README.md))

#### 3.4 CDN & Caching ✅
- [x] Set up CDN for static assets (Cloudflare/CloudFront) ✅ (CDN guide created)
- [x] Configure browser caching headers ✅ (Enhanced CacheControlMiddleware)
- [x] Implement API response caching strategy ✅ (ETag middleware, granular caching)

