## Phase 4: Monitoring & Observability 📊 (Priority: High)

**Goal:** Full visibility into application health and issues

### Tasks

#### 4.1 Error Tracking ✅
- [x] Integrate Sentry for frontend error tracking ✅ (sentryService.ts)
- [x] Integrate Sentry for backend error tracking ✅ (sentry_integration.py)
- [x] Set up error alerting (Slack/Email/PagerDuty) ✅ (documented in ERROR_TRACKING_SETUP.md)
- [x] Configure error grouping and priorities ✅ (GlobalErrorBoundary.tsx, filtering logic)

#### 4.2 Application Monitoring ✅
- [x] Add APM (Application Performance Monitoring) ✅ (Prometheus + Grafana stack)
  - metrics_service.py with request/DB/business metrics
- [x] Track API response times ✅ (http_request_duration_seconds histogram)
- [x] Monitor database query performance ✅ (db_query_duration_seconds)
- [x] Set up custom metrics for business KPIs ✅ (users, scans, payments, revenue)

#### 4.3 Logging Infrastructure ✅
- [x] Implement structured logging (JSON format) ✅ (logging_service.py)
- [x] Set up centralized logging (ELK, Loki, or CloudWatch) ✅ (Loki + Promtail)
- [x] Add request tracing (correlation IDs) ✅ (X-Correlation-ID headers)
- [x] Define log retention policies ✅ (30 days production, 7 days dev)

#### 4.4 Health Checks & Uptime ✅
- [x] Add `/health` endpoint for backend ✅ (health_check.py)
- [x] Add `/ready` endpoint for Kubernetes readiness ✅
- [x] Set up uptime monitoring (UptimeRobot, Pingdom) ✅ (documented)
- [x] Configure status page for users ✅ (StatusPage.tsx)

